<p>maalik se bhare ghar ke ujad jaane ko poocho<br />
ghar waalo'n se ye tafreqa padh jaane ko poocho<br />
maa baap se qismat ke bigad jaane ko poocho<br />
shabbir se akbar ke bichad jaane ko poocho</p>

<p>allah na dikhlaaye alam noor-e- nazar ka<br />
beh jaata hai aankho'n se lahoo qalb o jigar ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jis waqt ke akbar ko laga zaqm jigar ka<br />
seene me ruka aake dam us rashk -e- qamar ka<br />
girte huwe ghode se qayaal aaya pidar ka<br />
chillaye ke ab kooch hai dunya se pisar ka</p>

<p>bekas ki musafir ki khabar lijiye baba<br />
apne ali akbar ki madad kijiye baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bete ki sadaa sunke huwa sadma-e- jaa'nkah<br />
ek hook kaleje me utthi baith gaye shaah<br />
maloom huwa jaan chali aah ke hamraah<br />
dil thaam ke hatho'n se kaha ya asadullah</p>

<p>rang udgaya tha gesuo'n pa gard padi thi<br />
tyora ke jo sambhle to basarat me kami thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaye batado ali akbar kidhar aaye'n<br />
dhoonde'n tumhe'n ab bahar me ya sooe bar aaye'n<br />
betaab hai dil qalb me lashkar kidhar aaye'n<br />
tum uth nahi sakte to hami'n laash par aaye'n</p>

<p>maa baap ke jeene ka mazaa legaye beta<br />
oh'daa jo tumhara tha hame de gaye beta<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>beta hame phir yaa aba'taa kehke pukaaro<br />
mazloom ghareebul ghuraba kehke pukaaro<br />
nashaad-o- giraftaar-e- balaa kehke pukaaro<br />
lab tishna-o- mazbooh-e- qafaa kehke pukaaro</p>

<p>jo waqt moiyyan hai wo hargiz na talega<br />
qanjar meri gardan pa isi tarha chalega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>le aayi jo betaabiye dil laashe pisar par<br />
jhukte hi nazar pehle padi zaqme jigar par<br />
ek teer laga qalb-e- shah-e- jinn-o- bashar par<br />
seene pa kabhi haath ko maara kabhi sar par</p>

<p>oopar ke dam us sher ko bharte huwe dekha<br />
baba ne jawa'n bete ko marte huwe dekha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye darde jigar tham ke shah bahrobar aaye'n<br />
aye jaan na ghabra shah-e jinn-o- bashar aaye'n<br />
aye rooh tawaqquf shah-e- wala idhar aaye'n<br />
aye mout tahar jaa pidar aaye'n pidar aaye'n</p>

<p>armaan-e- dile-e- zaar pisar hosh me nikle<br />
hasrat hai ke dam baap ki aaghosh me nikle<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaye shah-e- dee'n ali akbar pidar aaya<br />
uttho mere pyaare mere dilbar pidar aaya<br />
tum dhoondte the aye mah-e- anwar pidar aaya<br />
nashaad pidar bekas-o- be par pidar aaya</p>

<p>kuch dil ki kaho baat karo hosh me aao<br />
sadqe pidar aao meri aaghosh me aao</p>

<p>mu khole ho kyu teer ko gardan se nikaaloo'n<br />
gar dard na ho haatho'n se baazu ko sambhaloo'n<br />
girta hai pahaad usko mai kis tarha se taaloo'n<br />
marte use dekhoo'n jise aaghosh me paloo'n</p>

<p>beh beh ke lahu me jigar aata hai tumhara<br />
seene se kaleja nazar aata hai tumhara</p>

<p>kuch mu se to bolo ali akbar, ali akbar<br />
aankhou ko to kholo ali akbar, ali akbar<br />
ruqsat bhi to holo ali akbar, ali akbar<br />
lo baap ko rolo ali akbar, ali akbar</p>

<p>dulha bhi is aaraam se sote nahi beta<br />
ham rote hai aur tum hame rote nahi beta</p>

<p>ghash me jo suni baap ki aawaaz pisar ne<br />
bas haath ko phaila diya us rashk-e qamar ne<br />
lipta liya chaati se shah-e- jinn-o- bashar ne<br />
mu khol ke dikhlaayi zabaa'n tishna jagar ne</p>

<p>farmaya ke qatraa mere jaani nahi milta<br />
majboor hoo'n beta mujhe paani nahi milta</p>

<p>ye sunte hi bas aankho'n se aansu huwe jaari<br />
mu pher ke dekha sooe sahra kayi baari<br />
ki arz huzoor aayi hai zehra ki sawari<br />
phir dard utha seene me aur ghash huwa taari</p>

<p>khole huwe aankho'n ko musaafir huwe akbar<br />
hichki ka bas aana tha ke aaqir huwe akbar<br />
</p>